/Title (Interpreting model outputs as probabilities using Softmax and picking predicted labels Picking a useful evaluation metric \(accuracy\) and loss function \(cross-entropy\) for classification problems Setting up a training loop that also evaluates the model using the validation set Testing the model manually on randomly picked examples Saving and loading model checkpoints to avoid retraining from scratch)
